flowchart LR
    A[Data Value Produced] --> B[Readiness Gate]
    B --> C{Status OK?}
    C -- No --> H[Informational Only / Hold]
    C -- Yes --> D{Version and Time OK?}
    D -- No --> H
    D -- Yes --> E{Permission OK?}
    E -- No --> H
    E -- Yes --> F{Policy Allows Action?}
    F -- No --> H
    F -- Yes --> G[Eligible for Action]
    G --> I[Evidence Snapshot]
    H --> I
